  "abstract": "Scale factor capacity to k=320 with factorized loadings L=U@V^T and reduced projection rank p=32 to test a more compute-efficient setting than p=40. Uses oscillatory 2nd-order SSM factors, input-adaptive temporal gating, global horizon gating, residual copy head, and MAE+curvature loss.",
